2026-07-28.json and 2025-11-25.json are the JSON Schemas of the Model Context
Protocol specification, https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol,
copied unmodified from schema/<revision>/schema.json at commit
1155ca460e5097019f32769b38dcba194432e2fb.

They are licensed as LICENSE in this directory states (the MCP project's
Apache-2.0 / MIT terms). They are test data only: they are not part of the
published crate (Cargo.toml `include` leaves tests/ out).

tests/conformance.rs validates every message the server sends in its
scenarios against the definitions of the matching revision, as the official
conformance suite's wire-schema check does.
